  {
    "name": "BS1/4/6 compact copy 1024",
    "pass": true,
    "button": {
      "w": 480,
      "h": 67,
      "font": "18px"
    },
    "quote": "center",
    "swatches": 6,
    "body": [
      {
        "text": "We begin with your taste, proportions and occasion, before a single line is drawn.",
        "lines": 1.99951171875
      },
      {
        "text": "We decide silhouette, collar, sleeve and hem together, drafting a pattern for your body alone.",
        "lines": 1.99951171875
      },
      {
        "text": "Six fabrics are laid out in daylight. Once the cloth is chosen, we record your measurements against your pattern.",
        "lines": 2.999267578125
      },
      {
        "text": "Your garment is built by hand in small batches, from cutting to seams, lining and finishing.",
        "lines": 1.99951171875
      },
      {
        "text": "The final fitting checks the skirt and shoulder. Last adjustments are made before your piece is pressed and wrapped.",
        "lines": 2.999267578125
      },
      {
        "text": "Continuous-filament silk catches light along every fold, with the deep, even colour a formal jeogori asks for.",
        "lines": 1.9998562116564418
      },
      {
        "text": "Plain-woven cotton softens with wearing, holding a crisp collar and cuff while staying cool against the skin.",
        "lines": 1.9998562116564418
      },
      {
        "text": "Spun from flax, linen stands slightly away from the body; its everyday creases belong to the material.",
        "lines": 1.9998562116564418
      },
      {
        "text": "Finely woven ramie lets light through. Mosi keeps a sculptural silhouette and softens with every wash.",
        "lines": 1.9998562116564418
      },
      {
        "text": "Weight, weave and colour change with each season’s cloth, giving the same pattern a different hand and fall.",
        "lines": 1.9998562116564418
      },
      {
        "text": "Silk woven in Sangju from domestic cocoons on narrow looms, with a quiet lustre that deepens with age.",
        "lines": 1.9998562116564418
      }
    ]
  },
